{"id":"b04a030dde171267","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-transparency.md","title":"相对于句子域的可证透明性","display":"df-transparency — 相对于句子域的可证透明性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-transparency","aliases":["91-df-transparency","91-df-truth-transparency"],"display":"df-transparency — 相对于句子域的可证透明性","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-positive-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-transparency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-transparency</span><span>91-df-truth-transparency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transparency — 相对于句子域的可证透明性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" href=\"?note=e4ff0dbf2ccbb847\" title=\"91-df-positive-formula\">91-df-positive-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为经典真理语言理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 为指定句子域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是一元原始谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\\)</span> 为下述元层逐句可证属性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transparency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\;[S\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transparency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\;[S\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对编码充分且包含 PA 的经典理论，全语言透明性与一致性不相容；该限制依赖自指能力，不是任意语言的一阶理论都会发生说谎者矛盾。\nTB、UTB、CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 都具有基础句子透明性；原书 KF 对所有正公式还有闭项统一去引号（Lemma 15.4），旧稿把它写成版本未定，现予明确。\n三值固定点中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X(T\\varphi)=v_X(\\varphi)\">\\(v_X(T\\varphi)=v_X(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是语义透明性。间隙值的双条件可能仍未定义，不能混同本节点的经典可证属性。透明域扩大也不是算术强度严格增加的充分条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Chapter 7；Definition 15.3、Lemma 15.4，印刷页 187；Lemma 15.13。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-positive-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e4ff0dbf2ccbb847","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transparency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\Delta}(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta\\;[S\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].","display":true},{"tex":"^-","display":false},{"tex":"v_X(T\\varphi)=v_X(\\varphi)","display":false}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"05c7f9f21bb85660","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Trans}_{D}(\\mathcal S,T)$\n(域上透明性, see [[91-df-transparency]])"},{"id":"567189f4b7e57f6f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}}(\\mathcal S,T)$\n采用 [[91-df-transparency]] 的全语言可证透明性。"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-transparency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-f